&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and maintain the global configuration of Atlassian Cloud applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support to end-users by troubleshooting issues and assisting with Atlassian tool-related inquiries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure user provisioning, workflows, automation rules, custom fields, schemes, permissions, add-ons, dashboards, reports, and integrations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure Confluence spaces, templates, and macros to improve collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhere to tools best practices and standard methodologies to maintain consistency across all instances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with stakeholders to improve user experience and UI configurations for Atlassian suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop custom scripts to automate administration tasks and enhance productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain comprehensive documentation for Atlassian configurations, features, and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure documentation is up-to-date and accessible to relevant stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide trainings to users and teams to increase user adoption and promote new features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or higher in Computer Science, Information Systems, Engineering, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of admin experience in managing Atlassian Cloud applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of hands-on experience with Atlassian REST APIs to perform bulk actions or build custom integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using various add-ons, such as eazyBI, custom charts, and script runner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/p&gt;
