&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;17&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8a935164b1e2&quot;&gt;This role joins the &#39;Technology Data Intelligence&#39; organization and plays a critical part in realizing our vision to accelerate the delivery of business outcomes across Okta by driving clarity, collaboration, and accountability in everything we do. We enable the broader TDI organization in the mission to “Accelerate Okta’s Scale and Growth”.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;362&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fb2ec4d3c90c&quot;&gt;Our team offers integration Engineering services that enable seamless connection and communication among various applications within Okta’s IT ecosystem. This ensures a unified, efficient environment where different systems work together to achieve our broader business goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;640&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5acaae296a29&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Staff Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; from the&amp;nbsp;global&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt; Integration Engineering team&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;which spans across the US and India, you’ll provide technical leadership, write hands-on code, and mentor peers while shaping Integration capabilities that empower Okta.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;887&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1f194c17fabc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;908&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d8a65780c6d&quot;&gt;Lead the design, development, and optimization of scalable cloud solutions using AWS, advanced databases, and infrastructure as code (Terraform).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1057&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3f794678de82&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain applications using Kotlin, Java, Node.js, and React, ensuring robust testing and front-end scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1185&quot; data-local-id=&quot;051929be3fb6&quot;&gt;Collaborate daily with US counterparts to align on architecture, share roadmaps, and ensure global consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1300&quot; data-local-id=&quot;07d7f3d64b97&quot;&gt;Stay updated on AI advancements to enhance project outcomes and drive innovation through Proof of Concepts (POCs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1418&quot; data-local-id=&quot;45f6e831e859&quot;&gt;Coach and support a geographically dispersed team, fostering skill development and technological mastery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1527&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3e8e31cb7bdc&quot;&gt;Maintain clear and accurate technical documentation for internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
