&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1622&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d9312892d479&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1650&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e8d3110ca5d7&quot;&gt;Technical Expertise: 8+ years of hands-on development and design experience with AWS services (Lambda, EventBridge, SQS &amp;amp; SNS, API Gateway, DynamoDB, Secrets Manager, EC2, AppFlow, Step Functions, Kinesis) and database technologies (PostgreSQL, DynamoDB).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1909&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9fd9efae6016&quot;&gt;Programming &amp;amp; Tools: Proficient in Kotlin, with experience in Java, Node.js, Python, and familiarity with TypeScript and React. Skilled in Terraform, JUnit, and Mockito. Experience with AI technologies is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2125&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8a505c71779b&quot;&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Development: Influences design, implementation, and support of business POCs. Coaches and develops individuals, with experience in geographically dispersed teams.&lt;/li&gt;
