&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Report Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Design complex Advanced, Matrix, Composite, and Trending reports using Workday Prism and Discovery Boards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;System Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Build scalable calculated fields and optimize report performance across HCM, Payroll, and Finance.&lt;/p&gt;
