&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate complex business requirements into actionable, high-performance dashboards for leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;3. Compliance, SOX &amp;amp; Audit&lt;/h4&gt;
