&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Root Cause Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead investigations into data inconsistencies and implement permanent remediation strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Continuous Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the evolution of data governance maturity across all HR systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;5. Strategic Collaboration&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Business Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Consult with People and Finance leaders to provide data-driven recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
