&lt;li&gt;Keen understanding and passion to learn about and share insights on digital design and industry trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, concept, inspire others, and roll up their sleeves while bringing creative ideas to life; can deliver and receive direct and clear feedback.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to think big while operating at the lowest level of detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be a self starter while being comfortable guiding teams, freelancers, agencies, and production partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to operate at a high level, providing art direction, to executing and delivering design deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
