&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is a &lt;strong&gt;Digital Expert&lt;/strong&gt; who lives at the intersection of technology and creativity. You are &lt;strong&gt;AI-first&lt;/strong&gt;, process-oriented, and possess the technical depth to navigate a complex B2B ecosystem. As a master of stakeholder management, you are as comfortable deep-diving into performance data with analysts as you are presenting high-level strategy to executive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and mentor a high-performing global team of paid media leaders, fostering a culture of innovation, accountability, and continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Funnel Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and execute sophisticated, multi-channel paid media roadmaps (Search, Social, Programmatic, ABM) that drive measurable pipeline for the Auth0 and Okta brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a key partner to Sales, Product, and Finance, effectively communicating the impact of paid media on the broader business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the charge in integrating AI-driven tools and methodologies into our media buying, creative optimization, and reporting workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and refine scalable processes and frameworks to ensure global consistency while allowing for regional nuances and agility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budget &amp;amp; Vendor Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee a significant global budget, maximizing ROI and leading strategic relationships with external agencies and platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Marketing Ops and Analytics to ensure seamless tracking, attribution, and data integrity across the digital ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years in Paid Digital Marketing with at least 8+ years of people management experience. Experience managing global, distributed teams is a significant plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;B2B Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven track record in the B2B SaaS space, understanding the complexities of long sales cycles and high-intent lead generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep technical knowledge of the paid media landscape, including advanced bid management, audience architecture, and attribution modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resourcefulness &amp;amp; Grit:&lt;/strong&gt; A &quot;builder&quot; mindset with the ability to navigate ambiguity, solve complex problems, and push through obstacles to deliver results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional ability to translate complex digital strategies into compelling narratives for a wide variety of roles across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; A data-obsessed approach to decision-making, with experience in Looker, Tableau, Adobe Analytics, and advanced CRM workflows &amp;amp; integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Learner:&lt;/strong&gt; A natural curiosity for what’s next—whether it’s the latest AI breakthrough or shifts in privacy regulations—and a passion for applying that knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Does this sound like you?&lt;/strong&gt; If you are a driven leader who wants to redefine what paid media looks like in the age of AI, we want to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
