&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;This key role involves building and leading a team of talented, passionate backend Java software engineers responsible for developing mission-critical and innovative identity and security products, specifically focusing on platform features for authentication and authorisation. This is an exciting opportunity to grow a team and deliver essential identity and security capabilities on Okta Secure Identity Platform.&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;At a high level, you’ll be managing your team’s goals, contributing to product strategy and helping to develop your employees. More specifically, you will -&lt;/p&gt;
