&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;837&quot; data-local-id=&quot;188cf7b08192&quot;&gt;Lead and grow a team of engineers responsible for FGA SDKs, the SDK generator, CLI workflows, IDE integrations, and developer automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;978&quot; data-local-id=&quot;156f6a92cffd&quot;&gt;Drive execution of the Developer Tooling roadmap in partnership with Product and FGA Core, ensuring alignment across OSS and SaaS surfaces and delivering meaningful improvements to developers on a frequent and predictable cadence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1212&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d3bd083b4c69&quot;&gt;Oversee the evolution of the SDK generator and template framework to maintain cross language consistency, configurability, and long term maintainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1369&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d1a5805f77ef&quot;&gt;Ensure consistent and high quality implementation of SDK features including authentication flows, error handling, retry logic, rate limiting, and advanced capabilities such as BatchCheck and ListRelations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1578&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6336f0b6a09a&quot;&gt;Establish and maintain strong engineering standards for testing, CI workflows, dependency management, release processes, and developer documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1731&quot; data-local-id=&quot;189aaef2cd00&quot;&gt;Foster a strong open source culture by ensuring community pull requests are reviewed promptly and contributors are supported in reaching a mergeable state.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1890&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2cbd6efdac9e&quot;&gt;Partner closely with FGA Core on API design and semantics to ensure a clean and developer friendly experience across all tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2023&quot; data-local-id=&quot;027538fbdd3d&quot;&gt;Support career growth and development through regular 1:1s, coaching, feedback, and performance management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2134&quot; data-local-id=&quot;624ed4589762&quot;&gt;Recruit and hire strong engineers to build and scale the Developer Tooling team in India.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2227&quot; data-local-id=&quot;427cbf7d70cd&quot;&gt;Maintain a team culture of ownership, transparency, rigor, and psychological safety in a distributed environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
