&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Field Analytics Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of Okta’s Go-To-Market Strategy &amp;amp; Operations group, the Field Analytics team is the primary engine for strategic analysis, enabling our leaders to make evidence-based decisions that determine the trajectory of Okta’s growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manager, Field Analytics Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Manager, Field Analytics to serve as a strategic partner of our Solutions Engineering and Partner organizations. You will transform complex data into actionable strategies, identifying key revenue drivers and building scalable analytical frameworks that directly influence Okta&#39;s strategic direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as the primary liaison between our data infrastructure and our most technical go-to-market branches. Your mission is to build scalable, flexible reporting that drives proactive insights that optimize technical sales productivity and accelerate partner-led growth while championing the adoption of emerging AI capabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a dedicated analytics lead for the Pre-Sales and Partners operations and leadership teams. Develop deep relationships to understand their business rhythms and operational needs, translating complex business questions into analytical frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Readiness &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the &quot;AI readiness&quot; initiative for field data. This includes exploring AI solutions to help pre-sales and partner teams drive growth, document processes, and brainstorm innovative ways to use AI tools for internal productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics Delivery: &lt;/strong&gt;Design, build, and maintain high-visibility Tableau dashboards and reporting assets. You will work in close partnership with our offshore delivery team to progress work faster and scale foundation reporting while you focus on high-complexity strategic projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years in an operational and analytical capacity (Sales Operations, Business Intelligence, or Revenue Analytics), preferably within a fast-paced SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level proficiency in SQL (Snowflake), BI Visualization tools (Tableau), and CRM data (Salesforce).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build advanced analytical models (e.g., productivity modeling, variance analysis) and high-visibility dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to look beyond the &quot;what&quot; to the &quot;why&quot; and &quot;so what,&quot; providing actionable recommendations that change business behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills, with a proven ability to distill complex technical findings into strategic narratives for senior executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A relentless curiosity and a desire to &quot;build it and own it,&quot; working both independently and collaboratively across a global delivery model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of experimenting with AI tools (e.g., Gemini, ChatGPT, Claude Code) or implementing AI-based workflows to optimize data modeling and automate documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with scripting languages (Python) and modern data modeling frameworks (dbt).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience supporting a Solutions Engineering or Partner/Channel organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SaaS GTM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
