&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Enablement Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Coordinate with Okta’s global enablement teams to roll out technical and sales training projects specifically for the India partner ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
