&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Operational Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain the hygiene of the partner pipeline within Salesforce; ensure all partner-sourced deals are accurately tracked and attributed.&lt;/p&gt;
