&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Performance Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Track and report on project milestones and partner performance metrics, providing data-driven insights to the Senior Regional Alliances Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Market Intelligence:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor local market trends and competitor partner movements to provide actionable feedback to the regional leadership team.&lt;/p&gt;
