&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5 to 8 years of experience in Partner Management, Channel Operations, or Project Management within the SaaS or Cyber-security industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Project Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to manage multiple complex workstreams simultaneously. Experience with CRM tools (Salesforce) and project management methodologies is essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;IAM Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; A foundational understanding of the Identity and Access Management (IAM) landscape or broader Cloud Security ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Execution Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of moving projects from &quot;concept&quot; to &quot;completion&quot; while meeting strict deadlines and revenue-driving KPIs.&lt;/p&gt;
