&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1862&quot; data-local-id=&quot;db016cdf-d129-4f8e-8836-a6bd9ce01fc7&quot;&gt;Participate on our on-call rotations for troubleshooting production issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1941&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cf6aabcd-b104-4442-bea4-eb5ae377a034&quot;&gt;Mentor other engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
