&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2014&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9763cc33-5ca6-4dd1-8e0e-ee181e6f716d&quot;&gt;Improve the team’s productivity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2050&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e77c5be1-207d-46fa-8893-6a39b5e291f2&quot;&gt;You are a good fit for this role if you:&lt;/p&gt;
