&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2094&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7e16ca8f-772c-4351-a8cb-8d3d3a084719&quot;&gt;Have 5+ years of software development experience.&lt;/p&gt;
