&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Senior Operations Manager Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Okta is hiring a Senior Operations Manager to support employee engagement for members of Auth0’s Engineering organization based in our Bangalore office.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is expected to be in the Bangalore office 5x/week.&lt;/p&gt;
