&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Senior Product Analyst - Workday Expense Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reporting to the Director of Finance Technology, this role will serve as the Workday subject matter expert for the Expense module and help drive day-to-day support and long-term enhancements across Workday Finance. You will lead configuration and continuous improvement, partner with stakeholders to solve pain points, and ensure scalable, accurate, and well-tested solutions as Workday evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the Workday SME for the Expense module, providing day-to-day support, troubleshooting, and resolving issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure and maintain Workday Expense, including business processes, security, data flows, and administrative tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead design, testing, and deployment of Expense solutions using Workday best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business stakeholders and COEs to gather requirements, improve processes, and drive adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reports and dashboards to support domestic and international finance operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Workday releases and upgrades by evaluating new functionality, coordinating testing, and implementing enhancements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain clear end-to-end business requirements and provide functional design leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver hands-on training and contribute to internal enablement across cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring to the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of Workday Product Analyst experience with 3+ years of hands-on Workday Expense configuration and support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in Workday Expense configuration, including Business Process Configuration, Security Administration, and EIBs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven functional knowledge of the Expense module, including delivered functionality and report utilization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong testing experience across unit, regression, UAT, and pre-launch validation for new features and enhancements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience balancing day-to-day system support with longer-term enhancement projects and related integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building and optimizing custom reports and dashboards in Workday or similar SaaS/enterprise platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, communication, and stakeholder management skills in fast-paced, cross-functional environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Agile workflows and tools such as ServiceNow and Jira&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And extra credit if you have experience in any of the following!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workday Studio, Workday Extend, and developing custom integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workday HCM experience (understanding of worker/org data and cross-module impacts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience customizing Workday Expense functionality and expanding into platforms such as Oracle Fusion Cloud or SAP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of driving automation and process optimization through workflow enhancements and reporting insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
