&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce certifications, such as Platform Developer I/II, CPQ Administrator, Application Architect, or Technical Architect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or implementing advanced Salesforce DevOps practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous work in a high-growth, SaaS, fast-paced technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
