&lt;h3 id=&quot;The-Opportunity&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b863317a-b602-4e99-a4db-b9247b4e4656&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;647&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;664&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9f21a262-6231-47d8-b8ff-920e600d02d3&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Senior Software Engineer, Applied AI&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll play a key role in building user-facing and backend systems that leverage GenAI to improve internal experiences and operations. This role requires strong full-stack engineering skills, with an emphasis on both AI integration and &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;building intuitive, performant UIs&lt;/strong&gt; that make AI accessible and useful to our internal customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1041&quot; data-local-id=&quot;232cffac-4779-4d33-a175-ae0cf44aa47c&quot;&gt;You’ll work closely with software engineers, product managers, and designers to build secure, intelligent tools for employees across Okta.&lt;/p&gt;
