&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3138&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8b8006f2247d&quot;&gt;Strong background in &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;distributed systems, APIs, microservices, container orchestration (ECS/EKS)&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;and cloud platforms (AWS/GCP/Azure)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
