&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3276&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2804d564-6327-429c-aaa4-be7a4394bcdf&quot;&gt;Familiarity with secure coding, authentication/authorization, and internal data governance best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
