&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1041&quot; data-local-id=&quot;232cffac-4779-4d33-a175-ae0cf44aa47c&quot;&gt;You’ll work closely with software engineers, product managers, and designers to build secure, intelligent tools for employees across Okta.&lt;/p&gt;
