&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1200&quot; data-local-id=&quot;06a0c599-60a2-457e-b327-6e66dedb5027&quot;&gt;Design and build &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;end-to-end GenAI-powered applications&lt;/strong&gt;, including web-based UIs, API services, and backend orchestration.&lt;/p&gt;
