&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3386&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f35a5588-4595-4173-8bcf-5fe0feda5556&quot;&gt;Ability to collaborate across engineering, design, and product teams — with a strong sense of user empathy and technical ownership.&lt;/p&gt;
