&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinking and solution design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem-solving and analytical ability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
