&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of IAM concepts, including OAuth 2.0, OIDC, and SAML.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience with lifecycle management, role-based access control (RBAC), and provisioning/deprovisioning.&lt;/li&gt;
