&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Passion for serving customers, demonstrated in a customer-facing role (ideally pre-sales, but consulting or support also valued).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ability to quickly communicate complex technical ideas, including on-the-fly whiteboard explanations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Elite communication skills, confident in dispensing knowledge and presenting to highly skilled and experienced audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
