&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Generative AI or LLM technology (LangChain, GenKit, LlamaIndex, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating with micro services, data lakes, or customer data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
