&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;e2ab23115b5e&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;You design for developers:&lt;/strong&gt; Tools, APIs, CLIs, SDKs, and admin dashboards. You know &quot;simple&quot; means something different for this audience.&lt;/p&gt;
