&lt;li&gt;7+ years of Site Reliability Engineering or equivalent systems administration experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Kubernetes and container orchestration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Linux/Unix systems administration background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of CI/CD and deployment strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good grasp of networking concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with infrastructure as code, infrastructure troubleshooting and general architecture&lt;/li&gt;
