&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1362&quot; data-local-id=&quot;af8243ab-ff94-4fce-9532-532dc5224a06&quot;&gt;Partner with Security, Data, and Infrastructure teams to ensure AI adoption is&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;secure, reliable, and enterprise-ready&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;What-We’re-Looking-For&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d68e1387-ddaf-4932-9541-f302520e5a62&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1604&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in software engineering, with a strong emphasis on backend systems design and development (5+ years in Python).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;4+ years with modern front-end frameworks (e.g., React, Vue, Angular), principles of accessibility (a11y), and an ability to collaborate effectively with Product &amp;amp; Design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;Proven experience integrating LLMs and MCPs into production-ready, user-facing applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;Experience with agentic frameworks like LangChain, LangGraph, and LangSmith is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
