&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence technical strategy and lead architecture decisions across global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills with experience working effectively across time zones and cultures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
