&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Snowflake or other data warehousing platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Amazon Web Services and modern cloud stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
