&lt;li&gt;Research and champion new technologies and architectural patterns to solve strategic challenges and scale the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and influence cross-functional initiatives, ensuring technical alignment and successful execution across multiple teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the operational posture of our systems by designing for observability, reliability, and scalability, and by mentoring others in operational best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and mentor senior engineers and act as a technical leader across the engineering organization.&lt;/li&gt;
