&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Administer and optimize our core productivity suite, including &lt;strong&gt;Google Workspace&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;strong&gt;Gemini&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Slack&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Asana&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Smartsheet&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Integration &amp;amp; Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the deployment, management, and troubleshooting of enterprise &lt;strong&gt;AI tools (specifically Gemini)&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring they are integrated safely and effectively into daily workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Create technical documentation and partner with cross-functional teams to drive best practices and high adoption rates of new applications and features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a Tier 3 escalation point for complex technical issues, supporting a fast-paced, 24/7 global environment from our Bangalore hub.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Standards:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and enforce global standards for tool usage, security permissions, and data governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify manual bottlenecks and use APIs or scripting to automate repetitive administrative tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring to the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience managing Enterprise-level &lt;strong&gt;Google Workspace&lt;/strong&gt; (DNS, Mail routing, Vault, DLP) and administrative experience with tools such as &lt;strong&gt;Slack&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Asana&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Smartsheet&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical experience managing and deploying &lt;strong&gt;Gemini&lt;/strong&gt; and other AI-driven productivity interfaces within a corporate framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Agility:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience working in a fast-paced environment supporting a distributed, global company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of implementing &quot;least privilege&quot; access models and driving standards in usage and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in Apps Script, Python, or Bash to manage large-scale migrations or system integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent verbal and written skills to lead training and influence standard usage across the org.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build With Purpose:&lt;/strong&gt; Work on meaningful problems that simplify and secure how &lt;strong&gt;Okta&lt;/strong&gt; operates at a global scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cutting-Edge Stack:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with the latest from Google’s AI suite (&lt;strong&gt;Gemini&lt;/strong&gt;) as well as other AI tools and functionality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow in a Technical Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Join a supportive, high-caliber team that values technical excellence, clean code, and personal development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
